      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "再说，像这样累积起来的素养也将化为自己的资产。\n我想充分利用每一次学习钻研的机会。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9b45496a27a0e79f3e9d3894c29bd90f5f8e3c6b7243dfea614258003b1b97ed",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
