      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "采取行动时的判断准则在于必要与否，而非个人喜好。\n我今天来此观展，只是因为感觉到“有必要”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "61426b416d5df01cd8a29ad12256558f2f2df116da45a5bfed01e470fdce4d16",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
