      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "第一红宝石说着，坚定凛然地挺直背脊。\n我知道那崇高的品格就是塑造出她目前样貌的核心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "be7ea381447807f6da90d05bc7ef5de42c9ace1f924d985aa5dc981cc41ccc44",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
