    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9733256e9425d2fce99fdcaa",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我回想起欣赏到一幅星空画的时候。那时她默不作声，\n只顾笔直地凝视着那幅画，令我感到有些难得。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f8995edecda01333a3db6186a3d46822c87826d2054dbf0fd25d474b91123f5a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
