    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cead16676be51b8fbe6cc765",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我有种感觉，似乎唯独那幅画给了她家族职责以外的事物。\n但即使开口询问她本人，想必也得不到肯定的回答吧──",
      "source_fingerprint": "b764cb0f973169b67ee3dd7461389bf197f9dfb1bea27be3eff63a08988d02c2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
