    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eec6619c81bdb34d97f93713",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我还以为她看到我买这么多会很傻眼，但她并未如此。\n看样子，她似乎也是来买想要的书。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1d6f8b4f29842573c561a8e5e70e59b275ddb3b8976c98571fa154f5f05d61fc",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
