    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3299d11a1de898a983cace51",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那是在白荧荧的星空中，唯一闪耀红光的孤高星体。\n我不禁觉得……简直就像她的化身。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7f89dbb05368488d23ef7505c067987148ccb26f6e929ee7df0486f227a8948b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
